        "filing_date": "2026-05-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manufacture high-performance spintronic products including sensors and couplers that are used to acquire and transmit data.",
        "start_character": 250,
        "end_character": 376
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376474-26-000348",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376474-26-000348-75240419a4665c0b",
        "accession_number": "0001376474-26-000348",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "NVE Corporation, referred to as NVE, we, us, or our, develops and sells devices that use spintronics, a nanotechnology that relies on electron spin rather than electron charge to acquire, store, and transmit information.",
        "start_character": 29,
        "end_character": 249
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376474-26-000348",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376474-26-000348-75240419a4665c0b",
        "accession_number": "0001376474-26-000348",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have invented several types of memory cells including inventions related to advanced MRAM designs and MRAM for tamper prevention or detection.",
        "start_character": 6951,
        "end_character": 7096
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376474-26-000348",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376474-26-000348-75240419a4665c0b",
        "accession_number": "0001376474-26-000348",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have patents on advanced MRAM designs that we believe are important, including patents that relate to magnetothermal MRAM, spin-momentum MRAM, and synthetic antiferromagnetic storage.",
        "start_character": 11989,
        "end_character": 12175
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376474-26-000348",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376474-26-000348-75240419a4665c0b",
        "accession_number": "0001376474-26-000348",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We sell standard (“catalog”) sensors, and custom sensors designed to meet customers’ exact requirements.",
        "start_character": 4635,
        "end_character": 4739
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001376474-26-000348",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376474-26-000348-75240419a4665c0b",
        "accession_number": "0001376474-26-000348",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "In the past fiscal year, we began marketing several new and improved products, including:",
        "start_character": 9109,
        "end_character": 9198
      },
      {
