        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001376474-26-000348-75240419a4665c0b",
        "accession_number": "0001376474-26-000348",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "Our unique products support global trends of efficient energy conversion and smart, low-power end nodes for the “Internet of Things.” To grow product sales, we plan to broaden our sensor and coupler product lines and enhance our product benefits in target markets.",
